OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after nursery shuts over
OL,4,Achild safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was arrested after a nursery
OL,7,Fwas shut by Ofsted who said it believed
OL,8,Fchildren may be at risk of harm.
OL,10,FWonderland Day Nursery in Wednesbury,
OL,11,FWest Midlands, had its license
OL,12,Fsuspended by regulators Ofsted on 13
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FPolice said a 38-year-old woman was
OL,16,Farrested from a Willenhall address on
OL,17,F15 October after they received "a
OL,18,Freport of a care worker ill-treating or
OL,19,Fwilfully neglecting an individual, at a
OL,20,Fbusiness in Wednesbury, on 6 October."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
