OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after nursery shuts over
OL,4,Achild safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson said: "We liaised
OL,7,Fwith other partner agencies and
OL,8,Ffollowing a thorough investigation by
OL,9,Fspecialist officers a woman was
OL,10,Finterviewed and dealt with by way of
OL,11,Fconditional caution."
